<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS BUY 268.44 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS WED.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS BUY 268.44 MLN RAND S.AFRICA BONDS WED.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 268.44 million rands worth of South African bonds on Wednesday after buying 286.21 million rands on Tuesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
